{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/782","id":5206622729,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTty1_c8AAAABNlbCCQ","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/782","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/782.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/782.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/issues/782","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/782/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/782/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/issues/782/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/statuses/2bdd252aa6c300b7431b9ee897b254b7953cf562","number":782,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"pon: bind costly W1 generation and cancellation to task ownership","user":{"login":"ProfHepta","id":102159240,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhbTiA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102159240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta","html_url":"https://github.com/ProfHepta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 问题与变更\n\n中奖后才生成证明会减少平均每次尝试的算力成本，但不会消除中奖后的完整证明等待。原有 native 验证任务接线也不足以证明昂贵 zkVM 生成已经进入实际 NativeTask/M12 资金与操作 owner 链。\n\n本 PR 将 fresh W1 生成接入已有 owner 和资源执行链，绑定原生 nonce 中奖、同一 statement、各原实验预声明的研究 deadline、进程及资源身份，并补齐独立 receiver、严格 expected-artifacts 验证、完整分段及递归路径。新增真实 owner 取消入口及 cold 读回；保留失败、Pending 和未释放的资源 cap。\n\n实际 C1 取消实验暴露了请求容量问题：339 个绑定文件的请求为 68,909 raw UTF-8 bytes，canonical 为 66,550 bytes，超过旧 64 KiB 上限，因而在 target 分发前失败。C1b 将 target、owner runtime 和取消 helper 统一到严格有界的 128 KiB raw UTF-8 解析器，拒绝超限、重复键、非有限数和非 UTF-8 等非法输入；现有 V2 canonical/hash/stored domains 保持不变。旧失败操作及原 deadline 保留，未重派。\n\n## 可复核的实际结果\n\n| 实验 | 结果与边界 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 两份 fresh 完整证明 | 同一固定输入，各方案 1 次；每份 43 个新 segment、43 次 lift、42 次 join，0 递归 checkpoint 复用。分段/平衡 pipeline 6,044.373854 秒；顺序 5,939.121782 秒。两份固定输入研究样本不构成总体尾延迟或因果加速证明。 |\n| 独立接收与验证 | 本地及 ROG 均完成。原父进程时钟记录的 winner 到收齐 ROG 完整返回包为 6,648.759587 / 6,658.476311 秒，分别提前各原实验预声明的研究 deadline 542.217424 / 533.531039 秒；包含调度、传输及取回，不等于部署 WAN 延迟或中奖区块 Node admission。 |\n| 共同资源 ABBA | Rayon=2、2 CPU / 8 GiB，80 行全部完成；proof/native 内层验证耗时中位数之比（ratio of medians）13.063490 / 13.430828，receipt/native payload 字节比 5.191573。这 80 行新增证明生成数为 0，不消除完整生成试验的 worker/Rayon 配置及 owner 路径差异。 |\n| 原业务预算 | 4 秒 / 0.25 CPU / 2 GiB 实际 exit 124，0 完整 proof、0 ACK。7.402 秒的观察含清理；该窄探测未覆盖原业务完整的 hostile／确认交易／6 次确认矩阵。 |\n| A 的 funded operation | 实际完成 Reserve、M12 Prepare→Intent→BindJob、昂贵完整生成及独立验证；该操作的 M12 仍 Pending，NativeTask Reserved=1,000；GPU UNKNOWN、cap 保留；所审账本没有 provider Payment。 |\n| C1b 新 operation 的取消及 cold | 新 operation 真实启动固定 r0vm 后取消；target terminal/cancelled、sticky、不可重派，子 cgroup 递归为空。主任务及独立 cold job 均实际 exit 0；cold 复用同一 statement/operation/原 deadline，0 新生成、0 target cancel 请求、0 native 交易。NativeTask 已取消及退款，但该操作的 M12 仍 Pending、原 cap 保留；没有资源 settlement/credit 或正向 provider 付款。 |\n| 独立资金状态审计 | 原库的私有只读副本中，Prepare/Intent/BindJob/Cancel 各 1 条，序号与哈希链及原取消 packet 绑定；canonical height 2 一次包含。本金退款 1,000，取消交易账户净增 709，Reserve+Cancel 总净变 −710；费用相关残差未独立解码，不当作 provider 付款或资源 credit。 |\n\n完整记录和公开原件：[C2 evidence README](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cc4dd8bdd89309c635831db30b508af2f89419d7/evidence/pon-w1-fresh-runtime-20261107/README.md)、[machine-readable summary](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cc4dd8bdd89309c635831db30b508af2f89419d7/evidence/pon-w1-fresh-runtime-20261107/summary.json)。\n\n## 精确源码验证及固定 base 合并\n\n候选 **abab79dac0cb89eb2753d3f579119ac135650eb5**（C3），tree **194808f4a0db5d642aa746beb251ca9e9532cebb**，父提交为 C2 `cc4dd8bdd89309c635831db30b508af2f89419d7` 与 integration base `cb314bb4656e5da4844325cd83994ab4764fe8e9`。保留上游 admission/reorg 修改、两个冲突文件的合并及原实验边界，没有调整业务预算。\n\n两份完整生成、共同 Rayon=2 的 ABBA、4 秒窄预算探测及 ROG 接收来自 A。C1 保留容量超限的 pre-dispatch 失败。真正启动昂贵生成后的取消与 cold 来自新 operation 的 C1b。C3 执行源码、构建和保留控制资格检查，新增完整 proof 为 0，没有重新归属历史实验。\n\n四组组件均在固定 C3 取得真实 succeeded / exit 0、完整且持久的输出；69 条组件命令（backend 13、native/receiver 21、owner/M12 16、CI 19），另有 publication-map 12 条、aggregate 4 条，合计 **85 条成功命令、776 项实际测试结果**。另 3 个 heavy 入口明确 ignored。CI 471 项包含 mandatory 104，0 skip；新增 1 个 retained admission 和 5 个 retained reorg 控制单独计数。前后全树 source report 完全相同。\n\n选择性冻结集合实际为 3,057 个路径，全树 source report 为 15,332 个 tracked entries、1,672,127,995 bytes。map01 的旧集合覆盖假设失败后，map02 显式补入已有但未选中的 STATE_RECOVERY 路径；原失败记录保留。原 C1/C1b 部分 cache 路径在本轮重新观察时缺失，不能宣称它们当前全部保全；使用实际可读且 hash 固定的 C2 缓存创建独立 C3 targets。末端聚合实际前后读取了 C2 五角色原件，五份 pin 均未变；旧 C1/C1b 当前二进制保全仍为 UNKNOWN。缓存复制、retained guest 和非独立 cleanroom build 的限制继续保留。\n\n验证记录位于既有文档分支 `docs/chain-w1-runtime-qualification-20261107`，并保留原 D1 的 12 个证据文件逐字不变。文档提交 D2 仅追加事后资格，不冒充已运行源码。\n\n- [C3 qualification README](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cb79a8eff1a046b942811001a036e64259fcaeec/evidence/pon-w1-c3-publication-qualification-20261107/README.md)\n- [qualification.json](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cb79a8eff1a046b942811001a036e64259fcaeec/evidence/pon-w1-c3-publication-qualification-20261107/qualification.json)\n- [公开逐文件 inventory](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cb79a8eff1a046b942811001a036e64259fcaeec/evidence/pon-w1-c3-publication-qualification-20261107/artifact-inventory.json)\n\n## 保留的 GitHub 负面观测\n\nC2 的后续快照为 104 项：82 success、3 skipped、16 failure、3 running；这不是全局终态，也不是 C3 的远端结果。失败中已定位的 native 原业务压力样本未通过原 4 秒 / 6 次确认条件；ACK 不当作确认。历史 artifact 实际返回 404 且原 run 的列表为空，原因未获证实。CodeQL export 在期限内未稳定完成，不等于发现漏洞。其余只读外层失败与未读取内层 artifact 分别保留，不推定共同根因。\n\n末端 aggregate01 的首次 sourceguard 在原 180 秒时限内未完成；原失败保留。独立 aggregate02 在相同资格逻辑、资源和时限下完成，仅增加分步及实际资源日志；没有将失败计入成功命令。归档 688 个选定成员、50,478,108 解压字节全部读回核哈希；历史 MCP 文本导出的缺口另有明示，未补造返回文本。\n\n[C2 原始负面证据](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cb79a8eff1a046b942811001a036e64259fcaeec/evidence/pon-w1-c3-publication-qualification-20261107/github-C2-readback/README.md)；[后续原始 job logs 与快照](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/blob/cb79a8eff1a046b942811001a036e64259fcaeec/evidence/pon-w1-c3-publication-qualification-20261107/github-C2-late-readback/README.md)。\n\n## 保留的门槛\n\n四道工程门均保持 **HOLD**。已实际失败的预算观测按样本范围保留；尚未观测或未完成资格的部分保持 UNKNOWN 或未建立，本地通过不替代部署或安全资格。\n\n- 未证明部署 WAN、中奖 W1 的真实 Node admission、完整历史进程树 wait/reap 或完整资源计费；GPU usage 保持 UNKNOWN。\n- 尚未完成昂贵任务重组/超时的真实全路径、正向一次性 provider 付款、完整原业务预算、总体生成尾延迟或验证/传输部署收益。\n- 完整密码学、递归/AIR、PQ/QROM、语义、DA、模型效用及其余原有安全条件继续 HOLD；保持完整 v2 的独立 expected-artifacts 绑定，不套用旧 v1 的绑定缺口。\n- Kaggle CUDA 探针成功，但后续 build-only 请求被正常 guard 拒绝；Colab 原绑定/释放冲突及只读状态完整保留。0 GPU W1 proof，无绕过或外部服务激活。\n- 私有数据库页、完整私有 dump 不公开；公开证据使用逐文件 allowlist 和 SHA256 清单。失败的准备/观察/封装记录保留。\n\n普通 topic push，经 HeptaRuntime 本地 GitHub 通道的 ProfHepta 执行。本 PR 为 draft，base 为现有 integration 分支 `fix/chain-six-axis-performance-20261103`；不合并 main、不部署、不自审批准。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T22:56:45Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T07:13:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7b4a63b6f08687e93270407772951aa71087ca3d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:fix/chain-w1-runtime-integrated-20261107","ref":"fix/chain-w1-runtime-integrated-20261107","repo":{"id":1323087357,"node_id":"R_kgDOTty1_Q","name":"Trillionnium-Chain","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Trillionnium consensus, canonical runtime/state, proofs, finality, and operator tooling.","homepage":null,"language":"Rust","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["blockchain","rust","trillionnium"],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":479,"open_issues":479,"size":2259